From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] zig/c.zig: define RISC-V float ABI macros for @cImport

Zig 0.16's translate-c runs on Aro, whose predefined macros for RISC-V
stop at `__riscv` and `__riscv_xlen`: it never emits `__riscv_flen` or
`__riscv_float_abi_double`, which clang and GCC define for an lp64d
target. glibc's riscv `bits/setjmp.h`, pulled in by Python.h through
pthread.h, requires one of the `__riscv_float_abi_*` macros:

    /usr/include/bits/setjmp.h:35:3: error: unsupported FLEN

so the @cImport of python_shim.h fails and no manylinux_riscv64 wheel
can be built (reproduced identically on cp314 and cp314t; musl's
headers do not test these macros, so a musllinux_riscv64 leg of this
matrix would be unaffected, same as the zttp case this mirrors - see
CLAUDE.md gotcha 634).

Zig master already emits these macros from Aro (ziglang/zig commit
b46a7f3a25a6, "sync aro & translate-c"); this is unnecessary once
zuvloop moves to a Zig release that contains it (zuvloop currently
pins ziglang==0.16.0).

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not yet submitted; workaround for Zig 0.16, fixed by ziglang/zig b46a7f3a25a6 on master]
---
 zig/c.zig | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/zig/c.zig b/zig/c.zig
index 1c610ab..d7df92b 100644
--- a/zig/c.zig
+++ b/zig/c.zig
@@ -1,5 +1,15 @@
+const builtin = @import("builtin");
+
 pub const c = @cImport({
     @cDefine("PY_SSIZE_T_CLEAN", {});
+    // Zig 0.16's translate-c (Aro) predefines no RISC-V floating-point macros,
+    // so glibc's riscv bits/setjmp.h (reached via pthread.h from python_shim.h)
+    // hits `#error unsupported FLEN`. Define what clang does for an lp64d
+    // target; Zig master already emits these itself.
+    if (builtin.target.cpu.arch.isRISCV() and builtin.target.cpu.has(.riscv, .d)) {
+        @cDefine("__riscv_flen", "64");
+        @cDefine("__riscv_float_abi_double", "1");
+    }
     @cInclude("python_shim.h");
     @cInclude("context_shim.h");
 });
--
